<spell-notebook "loader theming">
	<header level="1">
		Loader
		<header>A loader alerts a user to wait for an activity to complete.</>
	</>
	<loader-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme with the public `--ui-loader-*` tokens: set one on the element, on any ancestor (a region, `:root`), or on
			the inner box through `::part(loader)`. They inherit into the shadow root, where the sheet reads each through a
			private alias, so nothing inside blocks them.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			/* every loader on the page */
			:root {
			  --ui-loader-speed: 0.8s;
			}
			/* one kind, on its box */
			ui-loader.thick::part(loader) {
			  --ui-loader-line-width: 0.3em;
			}
			```
		</>
		<message state="info" size="small">
			<markdown>
				`--ui-loader-slow` and `--ui-loader-fast` are ratios of `--ui-loader-speed`, so one change paces every style,
				`indeterminate` included. Never set the `--_ui-loader-*` / `--_loader-*` names: they're the sheet's private
				plumbing.
			</>
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-loader" playground>
				<ui-stack style="position: relative; height: 8em; border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-color); border-radius: var(--ui-radius)">
					<ui-loader visible></>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
